
# JOB SPECIFICATION — Retrospective IEC 61010 Compliance Survey & Technical Construction File (TCF) Uplift
## Heavy-Ion Radiation Test System — Image Sensor Characterisation Rig (Gen-1), with Generation-2 Compliance-by-Design Template Extraction

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Spec ID | JOB-SPEC-61010-001 |
| Revision | A (initial issue) |
