## 12. EXECUTION CHECKLIST FOR THE FUTURE AGENT (condensed)

1. Read §0; load precedence; open DECISIONS.md.
2. Resolve/default Tier-1 questions; Gate 0.
3. Author SYS-SAF-001; fix classification; Gate — boundary signed.
4. Freeze SYS-CFG-001; sweep the full pack file-by-file into the register with E-states; open SYS-DDR-001 and SYS-CMP-001; Gate 1.
5. Author SYS-RISK-001 (+annex), SYS-RISK-002, SYS-REQ-002; open SYS-GAP-001; Gate 2.
6. Confirm clause set; build SYS-COMP-002 completely; finish component ledger; Gate 3.
7. Author SYS-SAF-003/004, SYS-MECH-001, SYS-SW-001, SYS-EMC-001 stub; uplift ICDs; issue SYS-VER-001; run/record HUMAN-ACTION tests; Gate 4.
8. Close gaps by the three routes; uplift manuals + labels.
9. Author SYS-SAF-010 and SYS-COMP-003; finalise TCF-INDEX-001; Gate 5 release.
10. Extract SYS-NG-REQ-001 + SYS-NG-001; hand to Gen-2 requirements capture.

*End of specification.*
